# Only what someone could use on THEIR OWN machine goes into this repository.
# Nothing that says anything about this particular one.
#
# Rule before tracking anything new: if the file carries a machine name, an
# account name, a SID, an SSID, a MAC address, a profile path, a serial number,
# or any reading taken from this system — it stays out.

# --- tooling and working context, not the product ---
CLAUDE.md
claude.bat
claude.ps1
.claude/

# --- internal specification: PRD, DESIGN, per-skill manuals ---
DOC/

# --- workflow: plans, questions, reviews ---
plan/
pytania/
przeglady/

# --- this machine's output and state ---
raporty/
stan/
tmp/

# --- raw system data, wherever it ends up ---
*.evtx
*.dmp
*.etl

# --- usual debris ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
